    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d318">

                <pb facs="0368" n="298" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv01/pg298"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    Woodrow Wilson Papers</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Technical Advisers to the Commission to Negotiate
                        Peace</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Scott</hi>, 
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Miller</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi>
                        </placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-30">30 December,
                            1918</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: Herewith in accordance with
                    your directions is a skeleton Draft of Peace Treaty,<anchor n="4"
                        xml:id="d318-f1"/> intended as suggestive of some of the questions which may
                    arise and of the difficulties connected with them. We did not understand that
                    you wished more than an outline of essentials at this time.</p>
                <p>As an appendix to the draft, will be found a discussion of questions concerning
                    signatories to the Treaty.</p>
                <p>Very sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>
                                
                                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">James Brown Scott</hi>
                                
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                
                                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">David Hunter Miller</hi>
                                
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d318-f1" n="4" xml:id="d318-f1-content">
